                                   title="Developer Mode reveals diagnostics and experimental work-in-progress features. These tools may change, break, or lose draft data."
                                   aria-label="Toggle Developer Mode"
                                   Style="position: absolute; bottom: 8px; left: 8px; opacity: 0.35;" />
